    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the shell dissolve\"... i dont know. it doesn't feel like a \"new beginning.\" it feels like there's nothing left to do. once you've lost the only thing that defined you, there isn't really a \"you\" to go back to. everything just feels so heavy and meaningless now.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
